      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اوسد فِى السَّيْرِ</span></b>  <i>He hastened,</i> or <i>was quick,
in his pace.</i> (L, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اوسدهُ</span>, (S, L, K,) or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اوسدهُ بِالصَّيْدِ</span>, (Msb,) <i>He incited him</i> (a dog) <i>to
the chase:</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آسَدَهُ</span>. (S, L, Msb, K.)

